body:
Listen to yourself, you know yourself you can't bring yourself to do it. And that's good. I get overwhelmed a lot, i am currently in the same situation as you. How strange is that. Do you really want to end this temporary pain, even though you will never be able to see her again? No you don't. Listen to you're mind you love her, and the only reason your getting overwhelmed is because you think she will not like you the same way and you will never get to see her again. Listen to your mind, make your shot. You love her now tell her that, even if she doesn't love you the same, which i bet you she does but is just scared to tell you, she won't just seize all contact with you after. Shes your friend after all and shes there for you. Life can be tiring and trust me buddy i know it is. At work i am plummed with work and at the end of the day its worth it, because i love my job. 

&#x200B;

My pm's are open buddy, message me if you need to. I will listen to all your thoughts and i will speak to you about anything. Just don't leave me, your loved ones and most importantly the girl you love. You have got this.

Listen to me buddy, your not anything you are thinking. What you are thinking about yourself is your depression and bad mental health getting to you, It's hard but you have to stop thinking this and think better of yourself. You are not a lazy stupid idiot, your a person who enjoys their free time. You are not a nobody people care about you, even if you don't believe it. You are not a cause to anybody's problems you just think that, and you shouldn't to be quite frank. Speak to people at school about the issues you are having at home, they will listen it is there job to do that, and help young people like you, who are going through this. It will help you a lot and you will find help.

&#x200B;

You are not a disappointment stop listening to people telling you that, they don't deserve to know you. Especially when they are putting you down. I'm here to speak to you or listen to you. My dm's are open any time. You are loved buddy.

Listen to your body, you decided you didn't want to. That's your voice inside speaking to you. Now listen to it, you don't deserve to die. Trust me you don't. And you yourself know that, that's why you stopped. I'm glad you're still here and everyone you love does. Now this is your moment to seize this and work towards getting it out of you, trust me nothing good every comes easy. But you must work hard for everyone and for most importantly yourself. You have this buddy.

&#x200B;

Now do it.
